WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.584 --> 00:00:17.070
It turned out Dad's ankle was badly sprained.

2
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.251
He could not walk for two weeks.

3
00:00:21.592 --> 00:00:26.594
"Since I can't work, let's all take a little vacation," Dad said cheerfully.

4
00:00:26.614 --> 00:00:31.856
"We can spend more time in the attic," whispered Vinnie to Mandy.

5
00:00:34.012 --> 00:00:35.533
They started up the stairs.

6
00:00:35.553 --> 00:00:40.998
"Mandy? I need your help," Mom called from the kitchen.

7
00:00:41.018 --> 00:00:42.839
"Coming, Mom!"

8
00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:44.240
Mandy yelled.

9
00:00:45.101 --> 00:00:46.342
Then she turned to Vinnie.

10
00:00:46.362 --> 00:00:49.224
"Wait for me," she said.

11
00:00:49.244 --> 00:00:52.747
"Well, you'd better hurry up!"

12
00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:55.670
he replied, running up the stairs.

13
00:00:57.491 --> 00:01:00.293
In the attic, Vinnie picked up the photo album.

14
00:01:01.274 --> 00:01:03.356
He wanted to open it so badly.

15
00:01:04.288 --> 00:01:06.330
He listened for Mandy's footsteps.

16
00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:09.533
He looked at the clock on the attic wall.

17
00:01:10.473 --> 00:01:12.355
Fifteen minutes had passed by.

18
00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:15.638
"Come on, Mandy!"

19
00:01:16.258 --> 00:01:17.199
he said aloud.

20
00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:20.902
Impatiently, Vinnie opened the album.

21
00:01:21.903 --> 00:01:23.685
He stared at the next photo.

22
00:01:24.766 --> 00:01:28.569
The old man was standing in front of a large domed building.

23
00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:31.912
It had four tall towers around it.

24
00:01:32.944 --> 00:01:34.365
The towers were glowing.

25
00:01:39.527 --> 00:01:43.209
Mandy," Vinnie said, as his eyes closed.

26
00:01:44.529 --> 00:01:46.510
He fell down the dark tunnel.

27
00:01:49.811 --> 00:01:53.893
He landed on something hard, though not as hard as the ground.

28
00:01:55.154 --> 00:01:56.654
But he wasn't alone.

29
00:01:56.674 --> 00:02:00.116
"Ouch!" Vinnie cried.

30
00:02:01.404 --> 00:02:03.465
"You tried to leave me again!"

31
00:02:04.045 --> 00:02:05.466
Mandy was pinching him.

32
00:02:05.486 --> 00:02:12.328
"I waited but you were taking too long," Vinnie said, rubbing his arm.

33
00:02:12.348 --> 00:02:15.510
"You couldn't wait ten more seconds?"

34
00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:16.970
asked Mandy.

35
00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:21.232
Suddenly, something under them began to move.

36
00:02:21.252 --> 00:02:23.933
"Hey!" cried Vinnie.

37
00:02:23.953 --> 00:02:25.334
"What's happening?"

38
00:02:25.354 --> 00:02:30.676
"Vinnie! We didn't land on the ground," whispered Mandy.

39
00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:33.329
"We're on a camel!"

40
00:02:35.331 --> 00:02:39.634
The children were sitting in two saddles on a very large camel.

41
00:02:40.794 --> 00:02:41.815
"Where are we?"

42
00:02:42.515 --> 00:02:43.716
Mandy asked aloud.

43
00:02:44.277 --> 00:02:45.297
She looked around.

44
00:02:46.538 --> 00:02:51.482
Donkeys were pulling wagons loaded with wooden boxes of different sizes.

45
00:02:52.522 --> 00:02:54.203
Other wagons carried barrels.

46
00:02:55.364 --> 00:02:57.105
Some people rode on horses.

47
00:02:58.306 --> 00:03:00.608
Carpets were piled on top of camels.

48
00:03:01.852 --> 00:03:04.454
Everyone in the group moved slowly.

49
00:03:04.474 --> 00:03:07.336
"There are so many people!"

50
00:03:07.976 --> 00:03:08.657
said Vinnie.

51
00:03:08.677 --> 00:03:13.160
"And lots of animals too," added Mandy.

52
00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:17.263
"I wonder where we're going," said Vinnie.

53
00:03:17.283 --> 00:03:21.165
"Let me see the photo," said Mandy.

54
00:03:22.186 --> 00:03:23.387
Vinnie gave it to her.

55
00:03:24.067 --> 00:03:26.549
Mandy studied the photo for a moment.

56
00:03:26.569 --> 00:03:31.764
"It looks like a temple," she remarked.

57
00:03:33.105 --> 00:03:34.886
Their camel stopped suddenly.

58
00:03:35.846 --> 00:03:37.667
Everyone else had stopped too.

59
00:03:38.848 --> 00:03:41.469
A man on a horse stopped next to them.

60
00:03:42.489 --> 00:03:45.090
He was wearing a long robe and turban.

61
00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:51.293
"We are about to enter the city," he shouted to the travelers.

62
00:03:51.313 --> 00:03:53.974
"Look after your goods and animals.

63
00:03:55.255 --> 00:03:58.116
We don't want any strangers coming after our caravan."

64
00:03:59.456 --> 00:04:01.978
"Strangers?" Vinnie gulped.

65
00:04:03.199 --> 00:04:09.804
The man pointed ahead and cried, "To Istanbul— the greatest city in the great Ottoman Empire!"
